# Figma Foundation (single source for design tokens)

## Two Figma files (Foundation → Web Kit)

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| **Pelagornis RefineUI Foundation** | **Variables** single source — color, spacing, padding, radius, typography, shadow, and all tokens |
| **Pelagornis RefineUI Web Kit** | **Components** — UI assembled using **linked** Foundation variables |

- **Model**: Foundation → Web Kit (Web Kit is the component layer on top of Foundation).
- **MUST**: Every size·padding·gap visible in Web Kit must be **linked to Foundation Variables**. Do not invent arbitrary px or gaps. If a value is missing, update Foundation first, then mirror it in `packages/tokens`.

